 and help...]\nL17: \nL18: ### Topics\nL19: \nL20: 【2†Managing Your Household】 【3†Customisation】 【4†All Other Articles】\nL21: \nL22: ## Managing Your Household\nL23: \nL24: 5 articles\nL25: \nL26: ### How to create a my.tonies account\nL27: \nL28: 【5†Read Full Article →】\nL29: \nL30: ### How do I invite other members into my Household?\nL31: \nL32: 【6†Read Full Article →】\nL33: ### How do I manage Household members permissions?\nL34: \nL35: 【7†Read Full Article →】\nL36: \nL37: ### How do I change the name of my Household?\nL38: \nL39: 【8†Read Full Article →】\nL40: \nL41: ### How do I remove a Toniebox from my Household?\nL42: \nL43: 【9†Read Full Article →】\nL44: \nL45: ## Customisation\nL46: \nL47: 1 articles\nL48: \nL49: ### Change your personal data\nL50: \nL51: 【10†Read Full Article →】\nL52: \nL53: ## All Other Articles\nL54: \nL55: 1 articles\nL56: ### tonies® Account - Google Sign In\nL57: \nL58: 【11†Read Full Article →】\nL59: \nL60: 【12†tonies® Support】\nL61: \nL62:   * 【13†Imprint†login.tonies.com】\nL63:   * 【14†Privacy policy†login.tonies.com】\nL64:   * 【15†Cookie Settings】\nL65:   * © tonies GmbH\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn778view2 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"turn775view2\",\"lineno\":30}); Total lines: 1\nL0: Failed to fetch https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-us/articles/29036509409170-How-do-I-manage-Household-members-permissions: (400) Timeout fetching\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nHow do I invite other members into my Household? – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-us/articles/29036487201170-How-do-I-invite-other-members-into-my-Household)\nciteturn778view3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"turn775view3\",\"lineno\":30}); Total lines: 90\nL16: # How do I invite other members into my Household?\nL17: \nL18: Want to allow others into your Household to record messages onto your Creative Tonies? This is one of the best features about Creative Tonies! All that is required for the other members to have is a free 【10†my.tonies.com†my.tonies.com】 account. Follow these steps and you will be good to go in no time!\nL19: \nL20: How to invite other members into your Household:\nL21: \nL22: Using the tonies app\nL23: \nL24: 【11†iframe†www.youtube-nocookie.com】\nL25:   1. Open the tonies app and tap your profile picture in the top-right side of the screen.\nL26: 【12†Image: Profile.jpg】\nL27: \nL28:   2. Tap 'Household'.\nL29: 【13†Image: Permissions_Step_2.jpg】\nL30: \nL31:   3. Tap the red '+' plus sign on the top-right hand side of the screen.\nL32: 【14†Image: Invite_Step_2.jpg】\nL33:   4. Here you can select the permission level you want the new member to have. You can make them either a Full member (allowed to manage Tonieboxes, Creative Tonies and other members) or only a Creative Tonie member (may only edit Creative Tonies that you choose). Tap on the type of member you would like to choose.\nL34: 【15†Image: Invite_Step_3.jpg】\nL35: \nL36:   5. A prompt will appear to enter the individual's email address. Type in the email address and then tap 'Next'.\nL37: 【16†Image: Invite_Step_4.jpg】\nL38:   6. Tap 'Confirm'.\nL39: 【17†Image: Invite_Step_5.jpg】\nL40: \nL41:   7. Success! The member will now receive an email to accept the invitation.\nL42: 【18†Image: Invite_Step_6.jpg】\nL43: \nL44:   8. Below is an example of the email invitation the invited member will receive. All they need to do is click 'Accept Invitation' and they will be prompted to login to their account and confirm that they want to join your Household.\nL45: 【19†Image: HouseholdInvite2.jpg】\nL46:   9. Note that if you have chosen to make the member a Creative Tonie member, you will just need to follow through an additional process once the member accepts the invitation to select which specific Creative Tonies you would like them to have access to. For a full walkthrough of this process, check out our other support article here: 【5†How do I manage Household members permissions?】\n"
